# Cursor rules for FLOSC

The canonical, authoritative rules for this project live in **`AGENTS.md`** in
this directory. Read `AGENTS.md` before writing any code and obey it in full.

Short version:
- WordPress Coding Standards (WPCS) via `vendor/bin/phpcs` — the release gate
  is the referee, not visual memory.
- PHP 7.4 floor, `flosc` text domain, `flosc`/`FLOSC` prefixes.
- Sanitize input, escape output, prepared SQL, nonces, capability checks.
- No inline `<style>`/`<script>` in PHP. No `error_log`/`console.log` —
  `flosc_log()` only.
- No version bumps, zips, or deploys without Dainis confirming the change.
- Run `flosc-gate.sh` before claiming anything is submission-ready.